<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">1 Buṭrus</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Buṭ</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Buṭrus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṯabrat ṯamezwarut n arrasul Buṭrus</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ṯabrat ṯamezwarut n arrasul Buṭrus</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="s">Lmuqaddima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Nec ḏ Buṭrus ḏ arrasul n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">
    <char style="it">Tsekkiɣ-d ṯabrat-a</char> i yinni ig ixḍar Arebbi iy iǧan ḏ iƹezzaben itemzeǧaƹen ḏi lʼiqlim n Punṭus ḏ lʼiqlim n Galaṭya ḏ lʼiqlim n Kafadusya ḏ lʼiqlim n Asya ḏ lʼiqlim n Biṯanya. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Arebbi Babaṯneɣ ixḍar-ikenniw ƹlaḥsab mammec tuɣa issen netta zi qbeȓ, issiṣfa-kenniw s yijjen n ȓxeḏmeṯ n Arruḥ iqeddsen ḥima aḏ tṭaƹem i Ƹisa Lmasiḥ aḏ twaruccem s iḏammen nnes <char style="it">iy yuzzȓen</char>.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Aḏaywem imarni arḍa ḏ ȓehna s waṭṭas.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Netwaxȓeq-d ḏ jḏiḏ ɣar yijjen n lʼamal iddaren</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Aḏ itwabarek Arebbi, Babas n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ iy ḏaneɣ yucin s arraḥmeṯ nnes ṯameqqrant ad nexȓeq ḏ jḏiḏ ɣar yijjen n lʼamal iddaren wami d isekkar Ƹisa Lmasiḥ zeg imettinen. <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />Ḥima a nwareṯ ijjen n wagȓa ƹemmarṣ aḏ ifna ƹemmarṣ aḏ ixsar ƹemmarṣ aḏ ikcef wenni iy ḏawem itwaxemmȓen ḏeg ujenna. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Ƹlaḥsab lʼiman nwem Arebbi iḥeṭṭa-kenniw s ṯzemmar nnes ɣar yijjen n usenjem ig isewjeḏ netta aṯiḏ ismeḍhar ḏi Nhar aneggaru.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />S usenjem-a kenniw ṯfarrḥem waxxa ȓebƹaḍ zzaywem twaƹeddaben ȓexxu ḏi ȓemḥayen cwayt n ȓweqṯ. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Ȓemḥayen-a usint-id bac aḏ d smeḍharent illa lʼiman nwem netta aqaṯ ḏ ṣṣaḥ; netta isewwa ktar zi ddheb ig ifennan waxxa itwassiṣfa ḏi ṯmessi. Ḥima lʼiman nwem aṯ cekkaren aḏayes yiȓi ccan ḏ lqima xmi d ɣa imeḍhar Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Ṯḥibbem-ṯ waxxa war ṯ ṯeẓrim ca. Aqa ṯumnem zzayes waxxa war ṯ twiȓim ca ȓexxu. Kenniw ṯƹemmarem s yijjen n ȓefraḥeṯ ḏ ṯameqqrant war ṯzemmarem ca at tcarrḥem. <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />Aqa kenniw ṯqebbȓem lɣaraḍ n lʼiman nwem iƹni aḏ injem ȓaƹmar nwem.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">L'anbiya tuɣa sȓan x Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />X usenjem-a wanita ssiwȓen xas lʼanbiya, iƹni arḍa nni iy tuɣa ḏawem d ɣa imeḍharen. Niṯni rezzun xas mliḥ tfettacen xas aṭṭas. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Tuɣa rezzun xas bac aḏ ssnen meȓmi d ɣa imeḍhar usenjem-a ḏ ḍḍuruf nnes. Rezzun aḏ ssnen minxef issawaȓ Arruḥ n Lmasiḥ iy iǧan ḏaysen wami Arruḥ-a iƹȓem-asen zi qbeȓ mecḥaȓ iy ɣa itwaƹeddeb Lmasiḥ, ssenni mecḥaȓ iy ɣa itwasemɣar menbaƹd. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Ismeḍhar-asen-d i lʼanbiya belli manaya war ṯ xeddmen ca i yixef nsen, xeddmen-ṯ i kenniw wami ssawaȓen s ṯmesȓayin-a. U ȓexxu nnan-awem ṯimesȓayin-a yinni iy kenniw itbeccaren s Lʼinjil s jjheḏ n Arruḥ iqeddsen iy ḏawem d itwassekken zeg ujenna. Waxxa ḏ lmalaʼikaṯ ḏaysent mezȓi aḏ xzarent ḏi ṯmesȓayin-a.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iḏammen n Lmasiḥ iy ḏaneɣ isenjamen zi ddunect-a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Iḏen, swejḏem ȓaƹquȓaṯ nwem bac aḏ txeḏmem. Arrem-d ȓbaȓ nwem. Ggem lʼamal nwem ɣir ḏi arḍa <char style="it">n usenjem</char> nni iy ḏawem d ɣa immucen xmi d ɣa imeḍhar Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Iȓim am ṯarwa itṭaƹan, war ḏeffareṯ ca ccehawaṯ nni ṯiƹeffanin ṯinni iy ḏi tuɣa tƹicem ḏi ȓeqfaȓeṯ nwem iƹḏun. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Lla, itxeṣṣa aḏ tiȓim ṯeṣfam ḏi marra min teggem am mammec iṣfa Arebbi wenni iy ḏawem d iȓaɣan. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Aqa yura ḏi Lkitab: Iȓiṯ kenniw ṯeṣfam minzi nec ṣfiɣ.<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Meȓa ṯeqqarem-as "A Baba" i wenni iteḥsaben ȓexḏayem n kuȓ bnaḏem bȓa uḏemawen ataf itxeṣṣa aḏ tƹicem s yijjen n ṯiggwḏi axmi ɣa ṯƹezzbem <char style="it">ḏi ṯmurṯ-a</char>. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Aqa ṯessnem kenniw s yijjen n lfidya Arebbi issufeɣ-ikenniw-d zeg yijjen n ṯuḏarṯ ṯexwa iy ḏawem immucen zi ȓejḏuḏ nwem, walakin lfidya-ya iy xawem ixeǧes maci ḏ can n ȓḥajeṯ am ddheb niɣ am nnuqarṯ ig ifennan. <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />Lla, issufeɣ-ikenniw-d s iḏammen nni iy iɣȓan s waṭṭas n Lmasiḥ iƹni Izmar nni iǧan bȓa ȓƹib bȓa ȓewsex. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />U netta itwaxḍar qbeȓ ma d twaxȓeq ddunect-a, walakin ismeḍhar-iṯ-iḏ Arebbi ḏi zman-a aneggaru x ssabab nwem. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Zzayes netta iy zi tamnem zi Arebbi iy ṯiḏ isekkaren zeg imettinen, yuca-as lƹaḍama bac ttiqeṯ nwem ḏ lʼamal nwem tiȓin ḏi Arebbi.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Ȓexxu ṯessiṣfam ixef nwem wami ṯṭaƹem i lḥaqiqa bac aḏ tiȓi ḏaywem ijjen n ȓemḥibbeṯ jar wawmaṯen bȓa nnifaq. S manaya itxeṣṣa-kenniw aḏ texsem ayawya aṭṭas s wuȓawen nwem. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Aqa twaxeȓqem-d ḏ jḏiḏ maci zeg yijjen n zzarriƹeṯ ifennan; Lla, ṯenni war ifennin ca ƹemmarṣ, s wawaȓ n Arebbi iddaren itdumman. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Liʼanna:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">
    <char style="bd">&lt;Ccan n bnaḏem marra, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">
    <char style="bd">am nwar n arbiƹ ig iǧa. </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">
    <char style="bd">Kuȓ bnaḏem am arbiƹ netta. </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">
    <char style="bd">Aqa arbiƹ itisraw nwar nnes iweṭṭa, </char><verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />
    <char style="bd">maca awaȓ n Arebbi itɣima i ȓebda.&gt; </char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="1PE 1:25" />
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:25">Awaȓ-a netta ḏ Lʼinjil iy ḏawem d itwabeccaren.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Ijjen n uzru iddaren ḏ yijjen n ccaƹb amqeddes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Iḏen fa kkseṯ zeg wuȓawen nwem marra ccarr ḏ marra lɣeḏran ḏ nnifaq ḏ ȓeḥseḏ ḏ marra ȓbaṭeȓ. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Iȓiṯ am iḥḍiḍen, sɣuyiweṯ x uɣi nni iṣfan n Arruḥ iqeddsen bac azzayes ṯemɣarem ḏi lʼiman nwem ig isenjamen. <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />Aqa ṯeqqasem Siḏiṯneɣ netta mecḥaȓ ḏ aṣebḥan.<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Xmi ɣares d ṯqarrabem ɣar netta iy iǧan ḏ azru nni iddaren ƹiffen-ṯ iryazen walakin Arebbi ixḍar-iṯ iƹizz xas, <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />uȓa ḏ kenniw ƹaweḏ am ca n yizra iddaren zzaywem iy ṯbenna ijjen n ṯeddarṯ n Arruḥ iqeddsen. Ḥima aḏ tiȓim kenniw ḏ ijjen n jmaƹeṯ n ȓfuqaha ṣṣaliḥin, tqeddamem dbiḥaṯ rruḥiyaṯ yarḍa xasent Arebbi s ufus n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Qa manaya ig iqqar Lkitab:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">&lt;Aqa xḍareɣ ij n uzru, srusiɣ-ṯ x udrar n Lquds.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">Netta isewwa aṭṭas, ggiɣ-ṯ ḏi ṯɣemmarṯ n dsas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">Wenni iy zzayes ɣa yamnen war ineddem ca.&gt;<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Fa azru-ya isewwa aṭṭas i kenniw iy yumnen, yinni war yuminen ca lla. <char style="it">Aqa yura ḏi Lkitab</char>:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">&lt;Azru nni iy ƹiffen ibennayen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">iwqeƹ ḏeg umcan aṣebḥan ḏi ṯɣemmarṯ n dsas.&gt;<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />U ƹaweḏ <char style="it">iqqar</char>:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">&lt;Ij n ttirceṯ iy ḏi tenqȓaḍen yiwḏan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">ḏ yijjen n uzru iy ṯen iɣeṭṭȓen.&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Qa tenqȓaḍen ḏayes minzi ƹeṣṣan awaȓ nnes, amenni iy xasen yura.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Fa kenniw ḏ ijjen n ccaƹb itwaxḍaren ḏ ijjen n jmaƹeṯ n ȓfuqaha n Uzeǧiḏ ḏ ijjen n ȓgens ḏ amqeddes ḏ yiwḏan niṯni Bab nsen ḏ Arebbi bac aḏ tbeccarem s ṯmesȓayin ṯiṣebḥanin n wenni iy kenniw issufɣen zeg yijjen n ṯaǧest yarri-kenniw-d ɣar nnur nnes ƹajib. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Tuɣa kenniw ḏeg yijjen n ȓweqṯ maci ḏ ȓgens, ȓexxu kenniw ṯḏewȓem ḏ ccaƹb n Arebbi. Tuɣa ḏeg yijjen n ȓweqṯ war ṯessinem ca arraḥmeṯ n Arebbi, ȓexxu ṯessnem arraḥmeṯ nnes.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Ay imƹizzen inu, nec qqareɣ-awem i kenniw iy iǧan ḏ iƹezzaben ḏ ibarraniyen ḏi dduncet-a, beƹƹḏeṯ zi ccehawaṯ nni ṯiƹeffanin iy kenniw itḥaraben ḍed n ȓaƹmar nwem. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Ƹiceṯ s lmaƹqul jar ȓegnus. Meȓa tahamen-kenniw x can ȓḥajeṯ ḏ ṯaƹeffant uca niṯni ẓerren lḥasanaṯ nwem ataf aḏ ḥemḏen Arebbi ḏi Nhar nni iy xasen d ɣa ixḍeȓ.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṭaƹeṯ i yinni xawem iteḥkamen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />X ssabab n Siḏiṯneɣ ṭaƹeṯ i kuȓ lḥakem umi immuc ȓḥaqq nican aḏ iḥkem. Waxxa netta ḏ azeǧiḏ iteḥkamen x marra, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />niɣ ḏ lḥukkam iy d issekk <char style="it">uzeǧiḏ</char> aḏ ƹaqben yinni iteggen ccarr aḏ tcekkaren yinni iteggen min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Liʼanna manaya ḏ ȓxaḍar n Arebbi iƹni meȓa ṯeggim min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan ataf aḏ teqḍam x wawaȓen ijahȓen n iryazen nni iy ḏi ṯeǧa ṯubbuhȓiya u ṣafi. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Ƹiceṯ am yiwḏan iy ɣar ṯeǧa lḥurriya walakin war steƹmaleṯ ca lḥurriya-ya nwem bac aḏ tesnuffarem ccarr nwem; Lla, itxeṣṣa aḏ tƹicem am ixeddamen n Arebbi. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Weqqareṯ marra iwḏan. Sƹizzeṯ ayṯmaṯwem. Ggwḏeṯ zi Arebbi. Weqqareṯ azeǧiḏ.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Qebbȓeṯ aƹeddeb ƹlaḥsab Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Ay ixeddamen, ṭaƹeṯ i ayṯbab nwem s lʼiḥtiram marra. Maci ɣir i yinni iǧan ḏ iṣebḥanen ḏaysen ttawaḍuƹ, lla, ḥetta ḏ yinni iqesḥen. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Cuf, meȓa ijjen iṭaƹ i Arebbi iṣbar i uƹeddeb netta war isḏiheǧ ca tamara nni, ma ḏayes can n ccuker? Wah, ḏayes ccuker. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Walakin meȓa ṯeƹṣam ṯeccim xas aƹmuḏ ṯeṣbarem x manayenni, ma ḏayes can n ccuker? Lla, walu. Meȓa ṯeggim ȓxir ṯetwaƹeddbem xas ṯeṣbarem xas, ataf manaya wah ḏayes ijjen n ccuker ḏ ameqqran zzaṯ i Arebbi. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Iȓaɣa-yawem-d Arebbi ɣar manaya minzi Lmasiḥ itwaƹeddeb ƹlaḥsab kenniw; Ijja-awem-d ijjen n lmiṯal aṯ tḏeffarem ḏeg isurifen nnes.<verse eid="1PE 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />Netta war iggi uȓa ḏ ijjen n ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:22">war ḏas d ikki uȓa ḏ ij uxarriq zeg uqemmum nnes.<verse eid="1PE 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Wami tuɣa xas tbuṣaren, netta war xasen d yarri ca abuṣar nsen. Wami tuɣa ṯ tƹeddaben, netta war ṯen iheddeḏ ca; Lla, netta isellem ixef nnes ḏeg ifassen n wenni iteḥkamen nican. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Netta s yixef nnes iysi ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nneɣ ḏi ddat nnes x ṯeḥnact<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯaḥnacṯ-a nettaṯ ḏ ṣṣalib nni iy xef immuṯ Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa.</char></note> nni ḥima a nemmeṯ neccin <char style="it">s wuȓawen nneɣ</char> i ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ, a neddar i min iǧan nican. Aqa s ujarriḥ nnes iy zi ṯgenfam kenniw. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Tuɣa kenniw am iḥuȓiyen itweddaren, ȓexxu ṯḏewȓem-d ɣar wenni iy kenniw irassen itkellafen zi ȓaƹmar nwem.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ȓuṣiyaṯ ƹlaḥsab iryazen ḏ ṯemɣarin nsen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />A ṯimɣarin, amenni ƹaweḏ itxeṣṣa aḏ ṭaƹent i iryazen nkent. Ḥima yinni war iteggen ca array i wawaȓ n Arebbi ataf ṯimɣarin nsen aṯen d arrent ɣar ȓmuminin bȓa ma akiḏsen ssiwȓent s wawaȓ ɣir s ṯicri nsent u ṣafi. <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />Yina ɣir aḏ ẓren ṯicri nkent ṯeṣfa tseḏḥant zzaysen <char style="it">ataf aḏ amnen</char>.<verse eid="1PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Zzin nkent maci ḏ lmuhim ɣar barra iƹni aḏ tmuḏent icewwafen niɣ aḏ teggent ṯisensȓin ḏ ṯemqeyyasin n ddheb niɣ ḏ arruḍ iy iɣȓan. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Lla, zzin nkent itxeṣṣa aḏ yiȓi ɣar ḏaxeȓ nkent iƹni zzin nni itiȓin inuffar ḏeg wuȓ. Zzin-a war ifenni ca ƹemmarṣ, ɣares arruḥ mhedden ḏayes ttawaḍuƹ ḏ yijjen n ccan ḏ ameqqran zzaṯ i ṯiṭṭawin n Arebbi.<verse eid="1PE 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Ammu iy tuɣa iǧa zzin n lallaṯ n zman srusant lʼamal nsent ḏi Arebbi. Tṭaƹant i iryazen nsent, <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />am Sara tuɣa iteggen array i <char style="it">uryaz nnes</char> Brahim traɣa-yas &lt;A siḏi.&gt; Kennint aḏ tiȓint am yissis iƹni meȓa teggent ȓxir war teggwḏent ca zi min isaggwaḏen.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Ay iryazen, amenni itxeṣṣa-yawem aḏ teggem ƹaweḏ, aḏ tƹicem ak ṯemɣarin nwem s yijjen n ȓefhameṯ jarawem. Ucem-as lqima i ṯemɣarṯ iǧan nettaṯ am ṯɣerrafṯ itrezzan ḏeɣya minzi ḏ niṯenti itwarraṯen akiḏwem lbaraka n ṯuḏarṯ. Ḥima war ḏinni tiȓi bu can n ȓḥajeṯ aḏ trez ṯẓaǧiṯ nwem.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wenni itwaƹeddaben x ssabab n ȓḥaqq ig itegg</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Lmuhim, itxeṣṣa-kenniw marra iḏwem ȓaƹquȓaṯ nwem aḏ iȓin ḏ ijjen, aḏ tesḥissem ak wayawya, aɣarwem ṯiȓi yijjen n ȓemḥibbeṯ n wawmaṯen, aḏ tḥinnem ḏeg wayawya, war ḏaywem itiȓi bu ttakebbur. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />War tarraṯ ca ccarr s ccarr nneɣni niɣ ȓƹib s ȓƹib nneɣni. Lla, barkeṯ inneɣni, mayemmi? Minzi iȓaɣa-d xawem i manaya bac aḏ txaȓsem s yijjen n lbaraka. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Liʼanna <char style="it">iqqar</char>:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">&lt;<char style="bd">Wenni irezzun aḏ iḥibb ṯuḏarṯ nnes, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">
    <char style="bd">niɣ ixes ƹaweḏ aḏ iẓer ussan ḏ iṣebḥanen, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">
    <char style="bd">u labud aḏ iḥḍa iȓes nnes zi ccarr, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">
    <char style="bd">ḏ uqemmum nnes zeg wawaȓ n ṯeḥȓaymiṯ. </char><verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />
    <char style="bd">Itxeṣṣa aḏ iggwej x ccarr aḏ igg ȓxir, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">
    <char style="bd">aḏ irzu x ssalam aṯ iḏfar. </char><verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />
    <char style="bd">Aqa ṯiṭṭawin n Siḏi Arebbi xezzarent ṣṣaliḥin, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">
    <char style="bd">imejjan nnes nurzmen i ṯẓaǧiṯ nsen. </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">
    <char style="bd">Maca uḏem n Siḏi Arebbi, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">
    <char style="bd">yarra aƹrur ɣar yinni iteggen ccarr.&gt; </char><verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Iwa meȓa ṯḥawȓem aḏ teggem ȓxir, min iƹna wenni iy kenniw ɣa iḍarren? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Walakin waxxa ṯetwaƹeddbem meȓa ṯeggim ȓḥaqq, aḏ yiȓi ḏ ssaƹḏ nwem. War teggwḏem ca zeg yiwḏan, war ṯen tejjam ca akenniw sḏehcen. <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Lla, semɣareṯ Lmasiḥ ḏeg wuȓawen nwem arrem-ṯ ḏ Siḏiṯwem. Iȓiṯ ȓebda ṯwejḏem bac aḏ tdafƹem x yixef nwem aḏ tjawbem wenni irezzun x ssabab n lʼamal iy ḏaywem. Walakin jawbem-ṯ s yijjen n ttawaḍuƹ ḏ lʼiḥtiram <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />ḏ yijjen n ḍḍamir mertaḥ. Ammu yinni xawem iqqaren ȓbaṭeȓ ataf aḏ seḏḥan s ṯicri nwem ṯaṣebḥant iy xawem tƹeyyaben niṯni.<verse eid="1PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lmasiḥ immuṯ ƹlaḥsab yinni iƹeṣṣan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Cuf, meȓa ixes Arebbi ataf ḥsen aḏ twaƹeddbem ƹlaḥsab ȓxir iy teggem maci ƹlaḥsab ccarr. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Amenni ig igga Lmasiḥ wami itwaƹeddeb ijjen n ṯwaȓa i ȓebda ƹlaḥsab ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ. Iƹni wenni iǧan nican itwaƹeddeb ḏeg umcan n yinni iƹeṣṣan ḥima akenniw issiweḍ ɣar Arebbi. Ddat nnes nɣin-teṯ, iseddar-it-id Arruḥ iqeddsen. <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />S Arruḥ-a iy zi iruḥ bac aḏ ibeccar arruḥaṯ <char style="it">n yiwḏan</char> nni itwaḥebbsen. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />Mayemmi? Liʼanna mecḥaȓ zeg wami ḏi zman n Nuḥ ugin <char style="it">yiwḏan-a</char> aḏ ggen array i Arebbi wami ṯen tuɣa itraja s ṣṣbar itṣennaƹ aɣarrabu <char style="it">n Nuḥ</char>. Ḏeg uɣarrabu-ya ḏrust n yiwḏan ṯmenya waha kkin x waman nni nejmen. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Aman-a niṯni ḏ ijjen n lmiṯal x ṭṭahareṯ <char style="it">nneɣ</char> n waman iy kenniw isenjamen ȓexxu. Maci aḏ itwakkes ȓewsex zi ddat nneɣ; Lla, ṭṭahareṯ-a nettaṯ ḏ ijjen n uȓaɣi nwem i Arebbi bac aḏawem d yuc ijjen n ḍḍamir mertaḥ. Manaya x ssabab n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ wami d ikkar zi ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />Ḏ netta igaƹƹḏen ɣar ujenna aqaṯ x ufusi n Arebbi, yarra lmalaʼikaṯ swadday n lḥukem nnes ḏ yinni iḥekkmen ḏ yinni ijehḏen.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s">Arenniṯ ḏi lʼiman nwem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Fa Ƹisa Lmasiḥ itwaƹeddeb ḏi ddat nnes. X manaya ƹaweḏ kenniw aḏ tesjehḏem ixef nwem s array nni nnes. Mayemmi? Meȓa ṯetwaƹeddbem ḏi ddat nwem, ṣafi ṯbeƹƹḏem ƹaweḏ x ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />X manaya nhuraṯ nni iy ḏawem itɣiman ḏi ddat nwem maci aṯen ṯseƹḏum ƹlaḥsab ccehawaṯ n bnaḏem; Lla, seƹḏum-ṯen ƹlaḥsab ȓxaḍar n Arebbi. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Iwa ṣafi, ṯejjiwnem zi min tuɣa tƹicem ƹlaḥsab min rezzun aḏ ggen lkuffar iƹni ȓeqbaḥeṯ ḏ ccehawaṯ ṯiƹeffanin ḏ waṭṭas n ccreb ḏ lfasad ḏ zzhu ḏ lƹibada n lʼaṣnam iƹiffen. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Tƹejjiben niṯni iƹni meȓa kenniw war kiḏsen tiḏfem ca ḏi lfayaḍan n ufelles-a aḏ qqimen ƹaweḏ tzawwaren-kenniw. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Walakin lḥisab nsen aṯ igg wenni iwejjḏen aḏ iḥaseb yinni iddaren ḏ yinni immuṯen. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />X ssabab-a twabeccaren s Lʼinjil uȓa ḏ imettinen. Mmuṯen mammec tmettan yiwḏan marra, walakin niṯni aḏ ddaren s arruḥ nsen ƹlaḥsab lɣaraḍ n Arebbi.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmuminin u labud aḏ steƹmalen lqudraṯ nsen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Aqa yusa-d uneggaru n marra ṯimesȓayin. Iḏen itxeṣṣa aḏ d tarrem ȓbaȓ nwem aɣarwem yiȓi ȓaƹqeȓ nwem bac ataf aḏ tzemmarem aḏ tẓaǧem. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Min iǧan muhim qaƹ? Itxeṣṣa aḏ tḥibbem ayawya zeg wuȓ minzi ȓemḥibbeṯ ṯqeṭṭa x waṭṭas n ddunub. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Labud aḏ treḥḥbem zeg wayawya am inewjiwen bȓa ma aḏ tceṯcam. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Itxeṣṣa-yas i mkuȓ ijjen aḏ isexḏem lqudra nni iy ḏas immucen ak yiwḏan. Aḏ isexḏem nican lbaraka n Arebbi iy zi itkellaf kuȓ nnuƹ nnes. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Wenni umi immuc aḏ issiweȓ itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ issiweȓ am wenni issawaȓen awaȓen n Arebbi. Wenni umi immuc aḏ ixḏem itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ ixḏem am wenni ixeddmen s jjheḏ ig iticc Arebbi. Ḥima s marra ṯimesȓayin-a aḏ itwaḥmeḏ Arebbi s ufus n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. Aɣares ṯiȓi lƹaḍama ḏ ȓeḥkam i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ. Amin.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmiḥneṯ n wenni iyumnen s Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Ay imƹizzen inu, war tƹejjibem ca ƹlaḥsab ȓmiḥneṯ-a iy xawem d iwḍan am ṯmessi bac akenniw ṯjarreb. <char style="it">War tfekkareṯ ca</char> belli manaya ƹajib. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Lla, itxeṣṣa kenniw aḏ tfarḥem wami ṯcarrcem ḏeg uƹeddeb n Lmasiḥ bac aḏ tfarḥem ƹaweḏ aṭṭas xmi d ɣa ṯmeḍhar lƹaḍama nnes. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Meȓa iwḏan tukkaren-kenniw ƹlaḥsab isem n Lmasiḥ ataf ssaƹḏ nwem, minzi Arruḥ n lƹaḍama ḏ Arruḥ n Arebbi imars-d xawem. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Ḥḍam akiḏwem yiȓi ijjen jarawem ig itwaƹeddaben minzi inɣa bnaḏem niɣ yucar niɣ ḏ lmujrim niɣ itaḏef ḏi ccɣuȓaṯ n midden. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Innama, meȓa can yijjen itwaƹeddab ȓaḥeqqac netta ḏ amasiḥi itxeṣṣa-as war itseḏḥi ca, u labud aḏ isemɣar Arebbi ȓaḥeqqac iysi-d isem nnes.<verse eid="1PE 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Aqa ṯuweḍ-d ȓweqṯ bac aḏ ibḏa lḥisab jar ayṯbab n ṯeddarṯ n Arebbi. Meȓa aḏ ibḏa lḥisab-a jaraneɣ min ɣa iweqƹen i yinni war itṭiƹin ca i Lʼinjil n Arebbi? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Aqa <char style="it">iqqar</char>:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">&lt;Meȓa iqseḥ aḏ injem can yijjen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">zeg yinni iǧan nican,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">mammec ɣa ggen yinni iƹeṣṣan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">ḏ yinni war itṭiƹin ca i Arebbi?&gt;<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Falihaḏa yinni itwaƹeddaben s array n Arebbi, itxeṣṣa-yasen aḏ sellmen ȓaƹmar nsen ḏeg ifassen n Lxaliq nsen netta iy ḏi ṯeǧa ttiqeṯ, aḏ qqimen teggen min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s">Ȓuṣiyaṯ ɣar imeqqranen n ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Fa nec tȓaɣiɣ-d x imeqqranen iǧan jar n ṯjumaƹ, nec iy iǧan ḏ ijjen n umeqqran am kenniw ḏ yijjen n ccaheḏ x min xef itwaƹeddeb Lmasiḥ, nec ḏ ijjen ƹaweḏ iy ɣa icarcen ḏi lƹaḍama iy d ɣa imeḍharen. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Arewseṯ ṯḥimerṯ nni n Arebbi iy xef kenniw itkellaf netta. Ḥḍam-teṯ s ȓxaḍar nwem maci s yijjen n bezzez iy xawem teggen minzi ammu iy ixes Arebbi. Maci s ṭṭmaƹ n ȓefḍiḥeṯ, lla s wuȓawen nwem. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Maci axasen tḥekmem s uziyyar x yinni iy xef tkellafem; Lla, aḏ tiȓim ḏ lmiṯal i ṯḥimerṯ iy ɣa tebƹen. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Xmi d ɣa imeḍhar Umeksaw ameqqran ataf aḏ tqebȓem ijjen n ttaj ƹemmarṣ aḏ ikcef.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Ay iḥenjiren, kenniw ṭaƹeṯ ƹaweḏ i yinni iǧan ḏ imeqqranen. Swejḏeṯ ixef nwem marra kenniw s yijjen n array ak wayawya war ḏayes bu ttakebbur minzi &lt;Arebbi aqaṯ ḍed n yinni isemɣaren ixef nsen, yinni isemzayen ixef nsen iticc-asen arḍa <char style="it">nnes</char>.&gt;<verse eid="1PE 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Iḏen, semzayem ixef nwem swadday n ufus ijehḏen n Arebbi, akenniw isemɣar ḏi ȓweqṯ iy ixes netta. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Marra imnusen jjem-ṯen i netta minzi netta ithella ḏaywem.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Arrem-d ȓbaȓ nwem, iȓiṯ ƹlabal. Ȓaƹḏu nwem Ibȓis qa itqeyyaḏ-kenniw am ssbaƹ ithirriw irezzu x wenni iy ɣa iseɣȓi. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Ƹarrḍem-as i Ibȓis, beddem nican x dsas n lʼiman nwem minzi ṯessnem belli ayṯmaṯwem ḏi marra ddunect-a aqa twaƹeddaben am kenniw.<verse eid="1PE 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Ataf aḏ twaƹeddbem cwayt n ȓweqṯ ȓexddenni akenniw isreyyeḥ Arebbi <char style="it">nneɣ</char> iy ḏi iǧa marra arḍa ḏ netta iy ḏawem d iȓaɣan ɣar lƹaḍama nnes war ifennin ca ḏi Lmasiḥ. Akenniw isbedd, akenniw isejheḏ, akenniw igg x dsas. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Aɣares yiȓi ȓeḥkam i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ. Amin.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lxitam n ṯebrat-a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Uriɣ-awem-d ṯabrat-a ṯamezyant x ufus n Silwan ḥessbeɣ-ṯ nec am umaṯneɣ ḏayes ttiqeṯ. Tcejjaƹeɣ-kenniw, cehhḏeɣ min qqareɣ manaya ḏ arḍa n Arebbi ḏ ṣṣaḥ. Beddem ḏayes nican.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Ṯsawwaḍ-awem-d sȓam jmaƹeṯ iy iǧan ḏi ṯendint n Babil, niṯni twaxḍaren am kenniw. Waxxa uȓa ḏ Marqus <char style="it">isawwaḍ-awem-d sȓam</char> wenni iǧan am memmi. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Tseǧameṯ x wayawya s yijjen n sȓam n ṯemƹacarṯ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Aɣarwem yiȓi ȓehna i marra kenniw iy iǧan ḏi Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>